S5-07 exact-nonce RDTSC per-RIP histogram delta — 2026-11-17

Scope and artifacts
-------------------
Offline attribution of the remaining 10,473-read CPL0 RDTSC difference using
the two schema-v14 sidecars from the canonical exact-nonce replays. This is a
data analysis slice; it ran no guest, changed no comparator, and made no
allowlist or normalization edits.

The replays and canonical input hashes are documented in
[the schema-v14 stack-copy replay log](s5-07-elf-stack-copy-snapshot-exact-replay-20261117.log).
They exactly reproduced their source stop/UART. The sidecar artifacts are:

| Run | Sidecar bytes | SHA-256 |
|---|---:|---|
| 0001 | 51,718 | `1444324e770114f9e290d5a7b33c4dadc80573055a68490ee6e64937e19d4f17` |
| 0002 | 54,676 | `64388e66f08ad4541c39b3fa2f37593fd5a121ebf8789dc088e4672182b25309` |

Both schema-v14 sidecars contain 22 CPL0 RDTSC sites, with
`rdtsc_cpl0_site_overflow_reads=0` and
`rdtsc_cpl0_unattributed_reads=0`. Summing the site histograms reproduces the
runner's complete source totals, 34,429,691 and 34,440,164.

